This plugin reads OpenYield Trading LLC's Data Services API with a token its
user holds. It contains no data of OpenYield's: its sample answers are made
up in the shape of OpenYield's public API documentation. This project is not
affiliated with or endorsed by OpenYield Trading LLC, FINRA or MSRB.
